Newly-created clones of the Wizard will keep coming after you, but they
won't have the Amulet.  (Some of them may carry cheap plastic imitations
of the Amulet.)  You'll have to go back down through the dungeon until
you find the one that took the original off you.

It's quite likely that you killed the one that stole the Amulet, then
forgot to pick it back up off his corpse - in that case, you'll need to
check each place where you fought him.


